# Prompt pages (no instruction page)

Saved paste (archive): `.cursor/saved/prompt-stepper/`. `PromptInstructionStepper.jsx` is unused in the live desk.

## Title

- File instance = `prompt.name` (default from the uploaded file name).
- Card / float title = `step.title`, seeded from that instance, **editable**.
- Do not bind the visible prompt title to `prompt.name` again. One PDF can hold prompts with different roles.

## Pages

- **All pages = prompts** (1-based caption). No leading instruction / Step 1 stepper page.
- Legacy files with an instruction page are normalized on open (`normalizePromptFile`) to prompt-only steps.
- PDF is a fixed reference; Extract page writes into the current prompt. Do not offer “save document” in this flow.

## Port rules (when the user asks to place related UI)

- JSX + CSS in the prompt desk. No `lucide-react`, `cn`, or `@/` aliases.
- Surface = `var(--surface-base)`.
- Do not confuse with document `StepSequenceBlockView`.
